msgid "Welcome Center first page: introducing KDE Plasma"
msgstr "Halaman pertama Welcome Center: memperkenalkan KDE Plasma"

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.plasma-welcome.appdata.xml:23
msgid "Welcome Center second page: how to install apps"
msgstr "Halaman kedua Welcome Center: cara memasang aplikasi"

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
